   "source": [
    "# Week 2: Image Processing with YOLO\n",
    "\n",
    "[![Open In Colab](https://colab.research.google.com/assets/colab-badge.svg)](https://colab.research.google.com/github/YOUR_GITHUB/ai-competition/blob/main/02-image-processing/image_yolo.ipynb)\n",
    "\n",
    "**เป้าหมาย:** เรียนรู้ YOLO fine-tuning pipeline — detection + classification\n",
    "\n",
    "> **Colab:** ไปที่ Runtime → Change runtime type → T4 GPU ก่อนรัน"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## 0. Setup"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Install ultralytics (includes YOLO latest)\n",
    "!pip install ultralytics roboflow -q\n",
    "\n",
    "import ultralytics\n",
    "ultralytics.checks()  # ตรวจสอบ GPU + version"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from ultralytics import YOLO\n",
    "import torch\n",
    "import cv2\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "import os\n",
    "\n",
    "print('GPU available:', torch.cuda.is_available())\n",
    "if torch.cuda.is_available():\n",
    "    print('GPU:', torch.cuda.get_device_name(0))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. โหลด Pretrained YOLO\n",
    "\n",
    "YOLO มีหลาย size — เลือกตาม tradeoff:\n",
    "\n",
    "| Model | Speed | Accuracy | ใช้เมื่อ |\n",
    "|-------|-------|----------|----------|\n",
    "| yolo-n (nano) | เร็วมาก | ต่ำสุด | ทดสอบ / edge device |\n",
    "| yolo-s (small) | เร็ว | ปานกลาง | **Competition Day** |\n",
    "| yolo-m (medium) | ปานกลาง | ดี | Balance |\n",
    "| yolo-l (large) | ช้า | ดีมาก | accuracy สูงสุด |\n",
    "\n",
    "สำหรับ competition: เริ่มด้วย `n` เพื่อ debug เร็ว → switch เป็น `s` หรือ `m` เมื่อ train จริง"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# โหลด pretrained model (download อัตโนมัติครั้งแรก)\n",
    "# ultralytics จะ resolve version ล่าสุดให้\n",
    "model = YOLO('yolov8n.pt')  # nano — เร็ว ใช้ debug\n",
    "\n",
    "print('Model loaded:', type(model))\n",
    "print('Classes (COCO):', len(model.names), 'classes')\n",
    "print('Sample classes:', list(model.names.values())[:10])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. โหลด Dataset\n",
    "\n",
    "**Option A:** ใช้ Roboflow public dataset (electrical equipment) — ดาวน์โหลดอัตโนมัติ  \n",
    "**Option B:** ใช้ dataset ตัวเอง — เปลี่ยน `DATA_YAML` path\n",
    "\n",
    "เราจะใช้ **Option A** ก่อน เพื่อเรียนรู้ pipeline"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Option A: Roboflow dataset\n",
    "# ใช้ electrical-components dataset จาก Roboflow Universe (public)\n",
    "from roboflow import Roboflow\n",
    "\n",
    "# ไม่ต้องมี API key สำหรับ public dataset\n",
    "rf = Roboflow(api_key=\"YOUR_API_KEY\")  # สมัครฟรีที่ roboflow.com\n",
    "\n",
    "# หรือ download ด้วย URL ตรง:\n",
    "# !pip install roboflow -q\n",
    "# project = rf.workspace(\"...\").project(\"electrical-components\").version(1).download(\"yolov8\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# ===== ถ้าไม่มี Roboflow API: ใช้ COCO128 sample dataset =====================\n",
    "print('ดาวน์โหลด COCO128 (dataset ตัวอย่าง 128 รูป)...')\n",
    "!wget -q https://ultralytics.com/assets/coco128.zip\n",
    "!unzip -q coco128.zip -d datasets/\n",
    "DATA_YAML = 'datasets/coco128/data.yaml'\n",
    "print('Dataset ready:', DATA_YAML)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## 3. Explore Dataset — ดูภาพ + Labels"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import yaml\n",
    "from PIL import Image\n",
    "\n",
    "# อ่าน data.yaml\n",
    "with open(DATA_YAML) as f:\n",
    "    data_config = yaml.safe_load(f)\n",
    "\n",
    "print('Classes:', data_config.get('nc'), 'classes')\n",
    "print('Names:', data_config.get('names')[:10], '...')\n",
    "\n",
    "# แสดงภาพตัวอย่าง\n",
    "train_images = list(Path('datasets/coco128/images/train2017').glob('*.jpg'))[:6]\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(2, 3, figsize=(14, 8))\n",
    "for i, (ax, img_path) in enumerate(zip(axes.flat, train_images)):\n",
    "    img = Image.open(img_path)\n",
    "    ax.imshow(img)\n",
    "    ax.set_title(img_path.name, fontsize=8)\n",
    "    ax.axis('off')\n",
    "plt.suptitle('Sample Training Images')\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ดู label format\n",
    "label_path = Path('datasets/coco128/labels/train2017')\n",
    "sample_label = list(label_path.glob('*.txt'))[0]\n",
    "\n",
    "print('Label file:', sample_label.name)\n",
    "print('Content:')\n",
    "with open(sample_label) as f:\n",
    "    for line in f.readlines()[:5]:\n",
    "        parts = line.strip().split()\n",
    "        print(f'  class={parts[0]}, cx={parts[1]}, cy={parts[2]}, w={parts[3]}, h={parts[4]}')\n",
    "\n",
    "print('\\nFormat: class_id  cx  cy  w  h  (normalized 0-1)')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Fine-tune YOLO\n",
    "\n",
    "**Transfer Learning:** ใช้ COCO pretrained weights → fine-tune บน PEA dataset\n",
    "\n",
    "Key parameters:\n",
    "- `epochs`: จำนวนรอบ (dataset เล็ก → 50-100 epochs พอ)\n",
    "- `imgsz`: ขนาดภาพ (640 = standard, 320 = เร็วกว่า)\n",
    "- `batch`: batch size (16-32 สำหรับ T4)\n",
    "- `lr0`: initial learning rate (default 0.01 ดีแล้ว)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Fine-tune\n",
    "results = model.train(\n",
    "    data    = DATA_YAML,\n",
    "    epochs  = 30,       # เพิ่มเป็น 100 เมื่อใช้ data จริง\n",
    "    imgsz   = 640,\n",
    "    batch   = 16,\n",
    "    name    = 'pea_equipment',\n",
    "    project = 'runs/detect',\n",
    "    patience= 10,       # early stopping ถ้าไม่ improve 10 epochs\n",
    "    save    = True,\n",
    "    device  = 0 if torch.cuda.is_available() else 'cpu'\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print('Training complete!')\n",
    "print('Best model saved at:', results.save_dir)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## 5. Evaluate — mAP, Precision, Recall"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Validate บน val set\n",
    "metrics = model.val(data=DATA_YAML)\n",
    "\n",
    "print('=== Metrics ===')\n",
    "print(f'mAP50:    {metrics.box.map50:.3f}  ← หลักสำหรับ competition')\n",
    "print(f'mAP50-95: {metrics.box.map:.3f}')\n",
    "print(f'Precision:{metrics.box.mp:.3f}')\n",
    "print(f'Recall:   {metrics.box.mr:.3f}')\n",
    "\n",
    "# mAP50 คือ metric หลักของ YOLO competition\n",
    "# > 0.9 = ดีมาก, > 0.7 = ดี, < 0.5 = ต้องปรับ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Plot training curves\n",
    "results_csv = Path(results.save_dir) / 'results.csv'\n",
    "if results_csv.exists():\n",
    "    df_res = pd.read_csv(results_csv)\n",
    "    df_res.columns = df_res.columns.str.strip()\n",
    "    \n",
    "    fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(14, 4))\n",
    "    \n",
    "    if 'train/box_loss' in df_res.columns:\n",
    "        df_res[['train/box_loss', 'val/box_loss']].plot(ax=axes[0])\n",
    "        axes[0].set_title('Box Loss')\n",
    "        axes[0].grid(alpha=0.3)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    if 'metrics/mAP50(B)' in df_res.columns:\n",
    "        df_res['metrics/mAP50(B)'].plot(ax=axes[1], color='green')\n",
    "        axes[1].set_title('mAP50')\n",
    "        axes[1].grid(alpha=0.3)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "    plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## 6. Inference — ทดสอบกับภาพใหม่"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# โหลด best model\n",
    "best_model = YOLO(str(Path(results.save_dir) / 'weights/best.pt'))\n",
    "\n",
    "# ทดสอบกับภาพตัวอย่าง\n",
    "test_image = str(train_images[0])\n",
    "preds = best_model.predict(test_image, conf=0.25, verbose=False)\n",
    "\n",
    "# แสดงผล\n",
    "fig, (ax1, ax2) = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(14, 5))\n",
    "\n",
    "# Original\n",
    "img = Image.open(test_image)\n",
    "ax1.imshow(img)\n",
    "ax1.set_title('Original')\n",
    "ax1.axis('off')\n",
    "\n",
    "# With detections\n",
    "result_img = preds[0].plot()  # draw boxes\n",
    "ax2.imshow(result_img[:, :, ::-1])  # BGR → RGB\n",
    "ax2.set_title(f'Detected: {len(preds[0].boxes)} objects')\n",
    "ax2.axis('off')\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "# แสดง detection details\n",
    "print('Detections:')\n",
    "for box in preds[0].boxes:\n",
    "    cls_id = int(box.cls)\n",
    "    conf   = float(box.conf)\n",
    "    name   = best_model.names[cls_id]\n",
    "    print(f'  {name}: {conf:.2f}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## 7. Export Model"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Export เป็น ONNX (portable — ใช้ได้ทุก platform)\n",
    "best_model.export(format='onnx')\n",
    "print('Exported to ONNX')\n",
    "\n",
    "# หรือเก็บ .pt ไว้ใช้ต่อ (แนะนำสำหรับ competition)\n",
    "import shutil\n",
    "shutil.copy(\n",
    "    str(Path(results.save_dir) / 'weights/best.pt'),\n",
    "    'pea_model_best.pt'\n",
    ")\n",
    "print('Model saved: pea_model_best.pt')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 8. Submission Pipeline — ส่ง CSV วันแข่ง\n",
    "\n",
    "โจทย์: รับภาพ → detect → ส่งผลเป็น excel/csv"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def predict_folder_to_csv(image_folder, model_path, output_csv, conf=0.25):\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    รับ folder ของภาพ → run detection → ส่งออก CSV\n",
    "    \n",
    "    Output CSV format:\n",
    "        image_name, class, confidence, x1, y1, x2, y2\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    model = YOLO(model_path)\n",
    "    image_paths = list(Path(image_folder).glob('*.jpg')) + \\\n",
    "                  list(Path(image_folder).glob('*.png'))\n",
    "    \n",
    "    records = []\n",
    "    for img_path in image_paths:\n",
    "        preds = model.predict(str(img_path), conf=conf, verbose=False)\n",
    "        \n",
    "        if len(preds[0].boxes) == 0:\n",
    "            # ไม่เจอ object\n",
    "            records.append({\n",
    "                'image': img_path.name,\n",
    "                'class': 'none',\n",
    "                'confidence': 0,\n",
    "                'x1': None, 'y1': None, 'x2': None, 'y2': None\n",
    "            })\n",
    "        else:\n",
    "            for box in preds[0].boxes:\n",
    "                x1, y1, x2, y2 = box.xyxy[0].tolist()\n",
    "                records.append({\n",
    "                    'image':      img_path.name,\n",
    "                    'class':      model.names[int(box.cls)],\n",
    "                    'confidence': round(float(box.conf), 4),\n",
    "                    'x1': round(x1), 'y1': round(y1),\n",
    "                    'x2': round(x2), 'y2': round(y2)\n",
    "                })\n",
    "    \n",
    "    df = pd.DataFrame(records)\n",
    "    df.to_csv(output_csv, index=False)\n",
    "    print(f'Saved: {output_csv} ({len(records)} rows, {len(image_paths)} images)')\n",
    "    return df\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "def predict_folder_classification(image_folder, model_path, output_csv, conf=0.25):\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    ถ้าโจทย์เป็น classification (1 label ต่อ 1 ภาพ)\n",
    "    → เลือก class ที่ confidence สูงสุด\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    model = YOLO(model_path)\n",
    "    image_paths = list(Path(image_folder).glob('*.jpg')) + \\\n",
    "                  list(Path(image_folder).glob('*.png'))\n",
    "    \n",
    "    records = []\n",
    "    for img_path in image_paths:\n",
    "        preds = model.predict(str(img_path), conf=conf, verbose=False)\n",
    "        \n",
    "        if len(preds[0].boxes) == 0:\n",
    "            top_class = 'unknown'\n",
    "            top_conf  = 0\n",
    "        else:\n",
    "            # เลือก box ที่ confidence สูงสุด\n",
    "            best = max(preds[0].boxes, key=lambda b: float(b.conf))\n",
    "            top_class = model.names[int(best.cls)]\n",
    "            top_conf  = round(float(best.conf), 4)\n",
    "        \n",
    "        records.append({\n",
    "            'image': img_path.name,\n",
    "            'predicted_class': top_class,\n",
    "            'confidence': top_conf\n",
    "        })\n",
    "    \n",
    "    df = pd.DataFrame(records)\n",
    "    df.to_csv(output_csv, index=False)\n",
    "    print(f'Saved: {output_csv}')\n",
    "    return df\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "# ใช้งาน:\n",
    "# df = predict_folder_to_csv('test_images/', 'pea_model_best.pt', 'submission.csv')\n",
    "# หรือสำหรับ classification:\n",
    "# df = predict_folder_classification('test_images/', 'pea_model_best.pt', 'submission.csv')\n",
    "\n",
    "print('Submission pipeline ready!')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Summary\n",
    "\n",
    "| Step | สิ่งที่ทำ |\n",
    "|------|----------|\n",
    "| Setup | ultralytics + GPU check |\n",
    "| Load YOLO | pretrained weights จาก COCO |\n",
    "| Dataset | YOLO format: images/ + labels/ + data.yaml |\n",
    "| Fine-tune | `model.train()` — 5 บรรทัด |\n",
    "| Evaluate | mAP50 (metric หลัก) |\n",
    "| Inference | `model.predict()` → bounding boxes |\n",
    "| Export | .pt หรือ ONNX |\n",
    "| Submission | CSV ด้วย `predict_folder_to_csv()` |\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "**เมื่อได้ data จริง:**\n",
    "1. Label ด้วย Label Studio / Roboflow\n",
    "2. Export → YOLO format\n",
    "3. เปลี่ยน `DATA_YAML` → train ใหม่จาก checkpoint นี้\n",
    "4. เพิ่ม epochs เป็น 100-200\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "**Next: Week 3 — Agentic AI**"
   ]
  }
 ]
}"
